{
  "key": 62603,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Hm... Good to see you here.\f",
        "No need to explain why you came.\r",
        "Clair sent you here, didn’t she?\f",
        "That girl is a handful...\r",
        "I am sorry, but I must test you.\r",
        "Not to worry, you are to answer only\n",
        "a few questions.\f",
        "Ready?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00001",
      "en_US": "What are Pokémon to you? {YESNO 0}"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00002",
      "en_US": "What helps you to win battles? {YESNO 0}"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "What kind of Trainer do you\n",
        "wish to battle? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "What is most important for\n",
        "raising Pokémon? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Strong Pokémon. Weak Pokémon.\n",
        "Which is more important? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Hm... I see...\n",
        "You care deeply for Pokémon.\r",
        "Very commendable.\f",
        "That conviction is what is important!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, don’t lose that belief.\r",
        "It will see you through at the\n",
        "Pokémon League.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00007",
      "en_US": "Hah? I didn’t quite catch that...\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00008",
      "en_US": "What was it you said?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00009",
      "en_US": "Oh, I understand...\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "So how did it go?\r",
        "I guess there’s no point in asking.\n",
        "You did fail?\f",
        "...\f",
        "...What? You passed?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00011",
      "en_US": "{SIZE 200}That can’t be!{SIZE 100}\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re lying!\n",
        "Even I haven’t been approved!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Clair!\r",
        "This child is impeccable,\n",
        "in skill and spirit!\r",
        "Admit defeat and confer the\n",
        "Rising Badge!\r",
        "...Or must I inform Lance of this?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00014",
      "en_US": "I... I understand...\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Here, this is the Rising Badge...\n",
        "Hurry up! Take it!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "the Rising Badge from Clair!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "The Rising Badge will enable your\n",
        "Pokémon to use the move for\f",
        "climbing waterfalls.\r",
        "Also, all Pokémon will know you as\n",
        "a Trainer and obey your every\f",
        "command without question.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Clair...\r",
        "Reflect upon what it is that you\n",
        "lack and this child has.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "...\n",
        "...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "By the way...\n",
        "Have you heard of LUGIA?\r",
        "It is a Pokémon said to have lived\n",
        "around Whirl Islands once...\f",
        "...Never mind.\r",
        "Just mad words of the old.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "By the way...\n",
        "Have you heard of LUGIA?\f",
        "Er...\r",
        "Between Olivine and Cianwood are\n",
        "islands called Whirl Islands.\r",
        "There is a huge waterfall deep in the\n",
        "cave there. It is said that LUGIA\r",
        "rests in the deep end of the\n",
        "waterfall basin...\r",
        "You need a Silver Wing to reach the\n",
        "waterfall basin, I’ve heard..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "There is a huge waterfall deep in the\n",
        "cave there. It is said that LUGIA\r",
        "rests in the deep end of the\n",
        "waterfall basin...\r",
        "You need a Silver Wing to reach the\n",
        "waterfall basin, I’ve heard..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00023",
      "en_US": "Come again, if you so desire."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s been quite some time since a\n",
        "Trainer has gained our Master’s\f",
        "rare approval.\r",
        "In fact, not since Master Lance."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00025",
      "en_US": [
        "You know young Master Lance?\r",
        "He looks so much like our Master\n",
        "did in his youth.\f",
        "It’s in their blood."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00026",
      "en_US": [
        "Hm... Good to see you here.\r",
        "Your arrival is most fortunate.\n",
        "I have something for you.\r",
        "Take this DRATINI as proof that I\n",
        "now know your worth.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00027",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "DRATINI from the Master!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00028",
      "en_US": "Hm? Your party is full."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00029",
      "en_US": [
        "Dragon Pokémon are symbolic of\n",
        "our clan.\r",
        "You have shown that you can be\n",
        "entrusted with one."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00030",
      "en_US": [
        "Clair appears to have learned an\n",
        "invaluable lesson from you.\r",
        "I thank you as her grandfather."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00031",
      "en_US": [
        "A boy close to your age is in\n",
        "training here.\r",
        "He is much like Clair when she was\n",
        "younger. It is a little worrisome..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0130_D44R0103_00032",
      "en_US": [
        "Give a nickname to the\n",
        "DRATINI you received? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
